2026-06-30 16:30:43.226 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:244 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: On the summer solstice, Mara felt her vocation stir with quiet purpose.  
She woke before dawn, with gratitude guiding her hands and satisfaction waiting in the kitchen.  
