2026-06-30 20:26:10.426 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:244 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: I began to improve my practice each morning, hoping to venture farther than before.  
My coach said steady practice would improve my balance and help me employ better habits.  
