2026-07-03 14:05:32.648 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:244 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: I decided to improve my English by joining a small practice group after work.  
At first, I was nervous, yet our teacher knew how to improve confidence quickly.  
