2026-07-04 14:14:16.617 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:244 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: On a rainy night, Maya planned a quiet travel route through the old harbor.  
She was a music prodigy, and her small concerts brought real entertainment to the town.  
Her brother tried to assure her the storm would pass before their travel began.  
But a strange vortex opened near the pier, twisting lights and pulling boats aside.  
Maya felt the vortex had changed her simple travel into a dangerous adventure.  
A thief tried to hijack a ferry, hoping the chaos would hide his escape.  
The prodigy kept calm and used her voice to assure the passengers.  
Even in the storm, her entertainment skills helped people stay brave and focused.  
Soon the police blocked the pier, ending the hijack and calming the vortex.  
By dawn, Maya was ready for more travel, still a prodigy of courage and entertainment.
